    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>The Haunting Voice</u></strong> is a psychological thriller with survival elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hide from monsters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829050/extras/35247d5b43655c5a4fb75c0ec2a5243d.poster.avif?t=1751569012\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829050/extras/35247d5b43655c5a4fb75c0ec2a5243d.webm?t=1751569012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829050/extras/35247d5b43655c5a4fb75c0ec2a5243d.mp4?t=1751569012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>You will have to solve complex, intricate puzzles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829050/extras/16f94e29abba9889abeb9a037b2c53e4.poster.avif?t=1751569012\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829050/extras/16f94e29abba9889abeb9a037b2c53e4.webm?t=1751569012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829050/extras/16f94e29abba9889abeb9a037b2c53e4.mp4?t=1751569012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI Fortress</strong> is a huge complex with many doors and passageways. There are so many offices that even the oldest employees don't know them all. A seemingly unremarkable place, but no one expected that one morning Richard would witness a terrible tragedy. Upon arrival at the office, he found a lot of mutilated dead bodies. You will have to find out what happened to all the employees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Richard Yard</strong> is a programmer at AI Fortress who is expecting a child with his wife Jane.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-The game is made on Unreal Engine 5 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Gameplay is closer to realism</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Explore a deserted office</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Find out what happened to its employees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Solve an interesting variety of puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Beautiful cutscenes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Fearful monsters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
